<title>USA: Sioux City cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade  moderate. Compared to Monday, slaughter steers and  heifers steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter  Steers:  Choice 2-3, 1250 lbs 64.10. Select and Choice 2-3,  1175-1275  lbs 63.00-64.00.  Select 62.00-62.75.</p>
<p>Returning  to  the feedlot 1000-1150 lbs 64.00-65.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter  Heifers:  Choice 2-3, 1175-1350 lbs  63.75-64.50.</p>
<p>Select and Choice  2-3, 1050-1250 lbs 63.00-63.75. Select 2-3, 62.00. Returning to the  feedlot 900 lbs 64.50.</p>
</text>
